  #line-at(72.024pt, 516.67pt, "field is below 0.33 mT, for which the nonlinear frequency shift of the edge-mode resonance is ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 535.63pt, "significant yet smaller than the edge-mode’s half-linewidth (Fig. 2).  So, at 1.935 GHz (Fig. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 554.59pt, "3 (b)), the incident spin waves are still at resonance with the edge mode, and their scattering ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 573.55pt, "is strong and accompanied by a phase shift of around ")
