  #line-at(72.024pt, 744.336pt, "the excitation amplitude is increased to 0.38 mT (Fig. 3 (c)) and then 0.64 mT (Fig. 3 (d)) is ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 763.416pt, "relatively slow.  This is due to the nonlinearity-induced asymmetry of the resonant line shape ")
